+     * Wave 50 (lane B8) — the blur radius is CONVERTED, not passed through.
+     * css-text-decor-4 §2.6 gives `text-shadow` the same blur semantics as
+     * `box-shadow`, and css-backgrounds-3 §6.1.2 defines that blur radius `r`
+     * as a Gaussian with standard deviation `r / 2` (Blink: skia_utils
